idth: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">총</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">2,400</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">를 선발할 예정입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">체계적인 직무교육과 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">현대</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">·</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기아자동차 </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">1</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">차 협력사</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">(</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전국</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">) </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">인턴 기회</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">를 부여하는 프로그램으로 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">훈련수당 외 역량개발비 </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">？ </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">취업지원금을 지급</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">하는 등 참여자 혜택이 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">청년의 실질적 취업경쟁력과 취업 기회를 지원하는 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">고용디딤돌 프로그램 </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">4</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기 청년인재 모집</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">(~4/23</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일까지 접수</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">)</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">을 위해 아래와 같이 권역별 상세설명회를 개최하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">많은 관심 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">.</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 목적 : 현대자동차그룹 고용디딤돌 청년인재 4기 모집 상세 설명회</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 내용 : 4기 프로그램 운영취지, 내용 및 일정 등, Q&amp;A</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 권역별 상세설명회 일정</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\